        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey, I’m making Landmaster – a pixel-art RPG where you get tossed into a big, living world full of strange creatures and secrets waiting to be found. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a mix of survival, crafting, and building: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and craft tools, weapons, and magical artifacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and defend your base against dangers that lurk in the Kingdom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different biomes, from quiet forests to dangerous ruins </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mystery of an ancient curse that’s tearing the land apart </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wanted Landmaster to feel like one big adventure, where every day can surprise you. One evening you might be fixing your base after an attack, the next you’re discovering a forgotten cave or making choices that shape the fate of the Kingdom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is still in a super early stage. It’s buggy, there’s not a ton of content yet, and things will break. But I’m working on it every single day, and I want to share the progress with players as it grows. Landmaster is not finished, but if you like the idea of exploring, building, and surviving in a weird little pixel world—and you don’t mind rough edges—you’re very welcome to join in early.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey, I’m making Landmaster – a pixel-art RPG where you get tossed into a big, living world full of strange creatures and secrets waiting to be found. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a mix of survival, crafting, and building: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and craft tools, weapons, and magical artifacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and defend your base against dangers that lurk in the Kingdom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different biomes, from quiet forests to dangerous ruins </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mystery of an ancient curse that’s tearing the land apart </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wanted Landmaster to feel like one big adventure, where every day can surprise you. One evening you might be fixing your base after an attack, the next you’re discovering a forgotten cave or making choices that shape the fate of the Kingdom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is still in a super early stage. It’s buggy, there’s not a ton of content yet, and things will break. But I’m working on it every single day, and I want to share the progress with players as it grows. Landmaster is not finished, but if you like the idea of exploring, building, and surviving in a weird little pixel world—and you don’t mind rough edges—you’re very welcome to join in early.</p>",
        "short_description": "Landmaster is a cozy pixel RPG about survival, crafting, and building in a magical world that doesn’t always play nice. Explore, create, and fight to keep your Kingdom alive.",
